      <section class="py-12 lg:py-24 relative overflow-hidden"><img class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full max-h-116 md:max-h-128" style="object-fit:cover;opacity:0.18" src="images/contact-particles.jpg" alt=""/><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full max-h-116 md:max-h-128" style="height:100%;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0) 60%, #fff 100%)"></div>
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative">
          <div class="max-w-lg mx-auto">
            <div class="text-center mb-20">
              <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl tracking-sm mb-6">Talk to us about your migration.</h1>
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-16">30 minutes, no sales pitch. Tell us what you're moving from and to — we'll bring an engineer who has seen something like it.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md">
              <div>
                <!-- D.13 — Contact form posts to Pages Function /api/contact
                     which sends via AWS SES to cognislimited@gmail.com -->
                <form id="contact-form" action="/api/contact" method="post" data-testid="contact-form">
                  <label class="block pl-4 mb-1 text-sm font-medium" for="cf-name">Full Name</label>
                  <input id="cf-name" name="name" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 mb-6 outline-none ring-offset-0 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-lime-500 shadow rounded-full" type="text" autocomplete="name"/>
                  <label class="block pl-4 mb-1 text-sm font-medium" for="cf-email">Work email</label>
                  <input id="cf-email" name="email" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 mb-6 outline-none ring-offset-0 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-lime-500 shadow rounded-full" type="email" placeholder="you@yourbank.com" autocomplete="email"/>
                  <label class="block pl-4 mb-1 text-sm font-medium" for="cf-company"><span>Company</span>
                                                          <span class="text-gray-700">(optional)</span>
                  </label>
                  <input id="cf-company" name="company" class="w-full px-4 py-3 mb-6 outline-none ring-offset-0 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-lime-500 shadow rounded-full" type="text" autocomplete="organization"/>
                  <label class="block pl-4 mb-1 text-sm font-medium" for="cf-system">What are you migrating?</label>
                  <div class="relative w-full mb-6 bg-white rounded-full"><span class="absolute top-1/2 right-0 mr-4 transform -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none">
                      <svg width="20" height="20" viewbox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M6.3999 8.2L9.9999 11.8L13.5999 8.2" stroke="#646A69" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></span>
                    <select id="cf-system" name="system" class="w-full px-4 py-3 text-gray-600 border rounded-full appearance-none cursor-pointer outline-none ring-offset-0 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-lime-500 bg-transparent relative">
                      <option value="">Select a system</option>
                      <option value="banking">Banking core (Flexcube, T24, Finacle)</option>
                      <option value="tax">Tax / revenue (TaxPro Max → Rev360, TIN, Tax ID)</option>
                      <option value="erp">ERP (SAP, Oracle EBS, Dynamics)</option>
                      <option value="identity">Identity / domain (Microsoft 365, Okta, Entra)</option>
                      <option value="other">Other</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                  <label class="block pl-4 mb-1 text-sm font-medium" for="cf-message"><span>Anything else?</span> <span class="text-gray-700">(optional)</span></label>
                  <textarea id="cf-message" name="message" rows="3" class="w-full px-4 py-3 mb-6 outline-none ring-offset-0 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-lime-500 shadow rounded-2xl"></textarea>
                  <!-- honeypot anti-spam field — humans can't see it, bots fill it -->
                  <input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;width:1px;height:1px" aria-hidden="true"/>
                  <button id="cf-submit" type="submit" class="flex w-full py-3 px-5 items-center justify-center font-medium text-white hover:text-teal-900 border border-teal-900 hover:border-lime-500 bg-teal-900 hover:bg-lime-500 rounded-full transition duration-200"><span class="mr-2" id="cf-submit-label">Book a 30-minute discovery call</span>
                    <svg width="21" height="20" viewbox="0 0 21 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path d="M5.25 10H15.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      <path d="M10.5 4.75L15.75 10L10.5 15.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg>
                  </button>
                  <p id="cf-status" class="text-sm text-center mt-4" data-testid="cf-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
                </form>
                <script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script>
                  (function () {
                    function init() {
                      var form = document.getElementById('contact-form');
                      var btn = document.getElementById('cf-submit');
                      var label = document.getElementById('cf-submit-label');
                      var status = document.getElementById('cf-status');
                      // Defensive: if any required element is missing (e.g. the
                      // user lands on a partially-rendered page or a CSS-locked
                      // crawler), do nothing rather than throwing — that throw
                      // would surface in window error handlers and look broken.
                      if (!form || !btn || !label || !status) {
                        if (typeof console !== 'undefined') {
                          console.warn('[contact] form elements missing, skipping bind');
                        }
                        return;
                      }
                      form.addEventListener('submit', async function (ev) {
                        ev.preventDefault();
                        status.textContent = '';
                        status.style.color = '';
                        btn.disabled = true;
                        label.textContent = 'Sending…';
                        var data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());
                        try {
                          var resp = await fetch('/api/contact', {
                            method: 'POST',
                            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
                            body: JSON.stringify(data),
                          });
                          var body = await resp.json().catch(function () { return {}; });
                          if (resp.ok && body.ok) {
                            form.reset();
                            status.style.color = '#5BB04F';
                            status.textContent = "Thanks. We've received your note and will respond within one business day, Lagos time.";
                            label.textContent = 'Submitted ✓';
                          } else {
                            status.style.color = '#B91C1C';
                            status.textContent = (body.error || 'Could not send right now — please email sales@cognis.group directly.');
                            label.textContent = 'Try again';
                            btn.disabled = false;
                          }
                        } catch (err) {
                          status.style.color = '#B91C1C';
                          status.textContent = 'Network error — please email sales@cognis.group directly.';
                          label.textContent = 'Try again';
                          btn.disabled = false;
                        }
                      });
                    }
                    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
                      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);
                    } else {
                      init();
                    }
                  })();
                </script>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 text-center mt-6">We respond within one business day, Lagos time. For partners, integrators, or press, email <span class="text-black font-medium"><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="bacadbc8ced4dfc8c9d2d3cac9fad9d5ddd4d3c994ddc8d5cfca">[email&#160;protected]</a></span>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- N.4 — What happens after you book. Sales-led pattern (Palantir, Snowflake,
           Datadog Enterprise). Setting clear expectations is the antidote to the
           "this is inconvenient" feeling — the friction becomes legible.
           Server-rendered inline (not iframe) so search crawlers, screen readers,
           and no-JS clients all get the content. The interactive Gantt at
           /how-we-engage.html remains as a richer standalone view. -->
      <section data-testid="what-to-expect" aria-labelledby="what-to-expect-heading" style="background:#FAFAF6;padding:64px 0">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
          <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2" style="color:#357a2d">After you book</p>
            <h2 id="what-to-expect-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-medium mb-4" style="color:#1F2657">What happens next</h2>
            <p class="text-base text-gray-700 mb-10">Five concrete steps — no surprises, no "we'll get back to you", and no procurement scramble. Banks and ministries know exactly when their teams are needed.</p>
            <ol class="space-y-6" role="list">
              <li class="flex gap-4" role="listitem">
                <span aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 36px;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:18px;background:#1F2657;color:#fff;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">1</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg" style="color:#1F2657">30-minute discovery call</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mt-1">We confirm scope (source / target systems, record volume, cutover window) and the regulator you need to satisfy. No slide decks; engineering on both sides.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4" role="listitem">
                <span aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 36px;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:18px;background:#1F2657;color:#fff;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">2</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg" style="color:#1F2657">Sandbox demo on your data</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mt-1">A 3-day sandbox where we ingest a sample of your real records (under NDA), surface the naming-drift exceptions you'd hit in cutover, and show the Reconciliation Agent fixing them.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4" role="listitem">
                <span aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 36px;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:18px;background:#1F2657;color:#fff;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">3</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg" style="color:#1F2657">Proposal &amp; MSA negotiation</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mt-1">Fixed-fee proposal scoped to your committed records + connectors. Master Services Agreement reviewed by your legal team. Bank transfer / purchase order / NET 30–60.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4" role="listitem">
                <span aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 36px;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:18px;background:#1F2657;color:#fff;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">4</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg" style="color:#1F2657">Tenant provisioned</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mt-1">Dedicated tenant on app-migratio.cognis.group with SSO wired to your IdP (Authentik, Azure AD, Okta). NDPA-compliant data residency in our Lagos region. Audit log on day one.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4" role="listitem">
                <span aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 36px;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:18px;background:#5BB04F;color:#fff;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">5</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-medium text-lg" style="color:#1F2657">First cutover with a war-room</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 mt-1">Our migration engineers join your cutover war-room on the night of go-live. Reconcile before cutover. Audit every record. Pass the regulator's review on the first try.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ol>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-10">Already a customer? <a data-app-link="/login" href="login.html" class="font-medium underline-offset-2 hover:underline" style="color:#1F2657">Sign in to your tenant →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div>
        <div>
          <section>
            <div class="p-4">
              <div class="max-w-xl lg:max-w-5xl mx-auto xl:max-w-none px-5 md:px-12 xl:px-24 py-16 bg-teal-900 rounded-2xl">
                <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
                  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center -mx-4">
                    <div class="w-full lg:w-2/3 px-4 mb-8 lg:mb-0">
                      <div class="max-w-md xl:max-w-none">
                        <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl xs:text-5xl sm:text-6xl tracking-sm text-white mb-6">Move with the platform that gets cutover right.</h1>
                        <p class="text-lg text-white opacity-80">Book a demo and we'll walk you through a live reconciliation on sample data — no setup required.</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-full lg:w-1/3 px-4 lg:text-right"><a class="inline-flex py-4 px-6 items-center justify-center text-lg font-medium text-teal-900 border border-lime-500 hover:border-white bg-lime-500 hover:bg-white rounded-full transition duration-200" href="contact.html">Book a demo</a></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
      <section class="relative py-12 lg:py-24 bg-orange-50 overflow-hidden"><img class="absolute bottom-0 left-0" src="fauna-assets/footer/waves-lines-left-bottom.png" alt=""/>
        <div class="container px-4 mx-auto relative">
